        "original_id": "f130bd7f-4b04-5860-9479-ef4ee4e905b9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The University of Texas at Austin\n- Teams: 1932–33 Texas Longhorns men's basketball team\n- People: Ed Olle, Ed Price\n- Roles: head coach, team captain, athletics director\n\nFacts:\n- Ed Olle was born on February 12, 1904.\n- During the 1932–33 season, the 1932–33 Texas Longhorns men's basketball team represented The University of Texas at Austin in intercollegiate basketball competition.\n- During the 1932–33 season, the 1932–33 Texas Longhorns men's basketball team was led by second-year head coach Ed Olle.\n- During the 1932–33 season, Ed Price captained the 1932–33 Texas Longhorns men's basketball team.\n- Ed Price later became the Longhorn football head coach.\n- Ed Olle was a college baseball player, a college basketball player, a men's college basketball head coach, and an athletics director at The University of Texas at Austin.\n- Ed Olle died on April 3, 1964.",
